  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO-UNITRAIN Youth Competence Development Project (UNESCO-YCD Project)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is based on 3 activities: 1) Implementing SDGs-based training (SDGT) and capacity building projects worldwide; 2) Implementing a UN SDGs Creative Contest &amp; Sustainable Design Contest Forum at the global level for youth; 3) Organizing youth leadership training for UNESCO member states to provide youth with a solid knowledge of the UN and the SDGs, with scientific capacity, and leadership training to be innovators and entrepreneurs. The activities will be contributing to achieving the outcome: &quot;enhanced capacity in science and engineering for Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs) among young people&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
